  "description": "The MSAGL GraphViewerGDI control lets you visualize graphs and has some other rendering functionality.\n      Key features:\n      (1) Pan and Zoom\n      (2) Navigate forward and backward\n      (3) Display tooltips and highlight graph entities\n      (4) Search for and focus on graph entities\n      (5) Collapse and open subgraphs\n      (6) Edit the graph",
